WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,350 --> 00:00:09,820
Zhou Ke, get over here right away. I'm injured. Bring your first aid kit. Hurry up.

2
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:18,200
I won't help you for free

3
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:24,780
Don't worry, I can't miss you. I'll give you a share of what you're going to eat later.

4
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:38,060
No need

5
00:00:38,060 --> 00:00:44,380
How long has it been since Dr. Zhou was still so aloof?

6
00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:50,960
Sooner or later you will eat it and die

7
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:53,060
I would rather die

8
00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:56,300
Then I can't bear it
